# CODE QUALITY RULES

## CRITICAL CHECKS (Before every commit)

### 1. NO !important in CSS
grep -r "!important" src/ | wc -l  # Should be 0

### 2. NO console.log in production
grep -r "console\." src/ --include="*.ts" | wc -l  # Should be 0

### 3. NO Russian comments
grep -r "//.*[А-Яа-я]" src/ --include="*.ts" --include="*.scss" | wc -l  # Should be 0

### 4. Run linter
npm run lint

## CODE STYLE

TypeScript: Use const/let, not var. Add proper types.
SCSS: Use CSS variables, not hardcoded values. No !important.
Comments: English only.

## COMMIT FORMAT

type(scope): Short description

Types: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, chore

Examples:
- feat(auth): Add JWT authentication
- fix(cart): Fix total price calculation
- docs(readme): Update installation guide

## SECURITY

Never commit: API keys, .env files, node_modules, passwords
Always check: .gitignore is complete, .env.example has NO real data
